## Interface: 120000, 120100, 120105, 16001
## Title: Forge's Ledger
## Notes: Records each character's gold and your warband bank gold for the Forge's Ledger app on this PC, with an at-a-glance bar for gold, Todo and the Great Vault. Click Sync on the bar, use the keybind, or type /fl sync to update the app immediately. /fl help for commands.
